    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3c <strong>Welcome to the game that will destroy your inner peace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your patience and skills in this chaotic yet addictive experience. The rules are simple: use your mouse to navigate through increasingly challenging levels while avoiding a silly image of a cat determined to ruin your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 levels of madness (for now \ud83d\ude09)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat-mouse intrigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, complex challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically... it\u2019s a <i>cool game</i>! \ud83d\ude0e Are you ready to take on the chaos? Play now and see if you have what it takes to conquer all 8 levels!</p>",
